{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"五年春正月，甲戌、己丑，陳侯鮑卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"夏，齊侯鄭伯如紀。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"天王使仍叔之子來聘。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"葬陳桓公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"城祝丘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"秋，蔡人、衛人、陳人從王伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"大雩。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"螽。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"冬，州公如曹。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"五年春正月，甲戌，己丑，陳侯鮑卒，再赴也。於是陳亂，文公子佗殺大子免而代之。公疾病而亂作，國人分散，故再赴。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"夏，齊侯、鄭伯朝于紀，欲以襲之。紀人知之。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"王奪鄭伯政，鄭伯不朝。秋，王以諸侯伐鄭，鄭伯禦之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"王為中軍；虢公林父將右軍，蔡人、衛人屬焉；周公黑肩將左軍，陳人屬焉。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"鄭子元請為左拒，以當蔡人、衛人；為右拒，以當陳人，曰：「陳亂，民莫有鬬心，若先犯之，必奔。王卒顧之，必亂。祭、衛不枝，固將先奔，既而萃於王卒，可以集事。」從之。曼伯為右拒，祭仲足為左拒，原繁、高渠彌以中軍奉公，為魚麗之陳，先偏後伍，伍承彌縫。戰于繻葛，命二拒曰：「旝動而鼓。」蔡、衛、陳皆奔，王卒亂，鄭師合以攻之，王卒大敗。祝聃射王中肩，王亦能軍。祝聃請從之。公曰：「君子不欲多上人，況敢陵天子乎！苟自救也，社稷無隕，多矣。」","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"夜，鄭伯使祭足勞王，且問左右。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"仍叔之子來聘，弱也。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"秋，大雩，書，不時也。凡祀，啟蟄而郊，龍見而雩，始殺而嘗，閉蟄而烝。過則書。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_16_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_16","textTraditional":"冬，淳于公如曹。度其國危，遂不復。","sentenceOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}